<title>UK: London timecharter fixtures.</title>
<headline>London timecharter fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial - (built 1989) 68,767 dwt 13 on 27 plus 2.5 del eastern Australia mid Oct trip Japan $7,000 daily plus $95,000 bb MOSK.</p>
<p>Aspidoforos - (built 1982) 35,055 dwt del Nopac early Oct trip Japan approx. $6,500 daily plus $100,000 bb Showa.</p>
<p>Angelia P - (built 1979) 22,549 dwt 13 on 24 plus 1.5 del Durban end Sept trip Continent approx. $3,800 daily IVS (reported).</p>
